B.be5=s(["Yon pwobl\xe8m rive. Eseye ank\xf2.","Un probl\xe8me est survenu. R\xe9essayez.","Something went wrong. Try again."],t.s)
B.bqe=s(["Baz lokal la pa aksesib. Relanse aplikasyon an.","Base locale inaccessible. Relancez l\u2019application.","Local database unavailable. Restart the application."],t.s)
B.bjx=s(["Navigat\xe8 a pa ofri depo lokal ki fyab. S\xe8vi ak yon navigat\xe8 ki ajou, san m\xf2d prive.","Le navigateur ne fournit pas de stockage local fiable. Utilisez un navigateur \xe0 jour, hors navigation priv\xe9e.","The browser does not provide reliable local storage. Use an up-to-date browser outside private mode."],t.s)
